repository-code: "https://github.com/gesiscss/gesis_surf_extension"

abstract: "GESIS Surf is an open-source browser extension for longitudinal web browsing data collection in research settings. It supports passive collection of browsing behavior and interaction data, hierarchical session modeling, configurable privacy policies, and communication with a self-hosted backend infrastructure."

keywords:
  - "web browsing data"
  - "browser extension"
  - "web tracking"
  - "digital behavioral data"
  - "longitudinal research"
  - "privacy-preserving data collection"

license: MIT
